{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, then approach it. If object is reachable, take it and evaluate its properties. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = EvaluateObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
